Case 7: class hierarchy as the inner, the GROUP BY is still sorted     

===================================================
colb    cnt    
1     3     
2     2     
3     2     

Query plan:
temp(group by)
    subplan: nl-join (inner join)
                 edge:  term[?]
                 outer: iscan
                            class: a node[?]
                            index: idx_colb 
                            cost:  ? card ?
                 inner: sscan
                            class: e node[?]
                            sargs: term[?]
                            cost:  ? card ?
                 cost:  ? card ?
    sort:  ? asc
    cost:  ? card ?
Query stmt:
select /*+ ORDERED */ a.colb, count(*) from tbl_a a,  all tbl_e e where e.coli=a.cola group by a.colb using index a.idx_colb
